## Entry for the Table of Contents
A metal-oxo nodes engineering strategy by reacting the Zr-OH groups with phenylsilane was for the first time reported to prepare super-hydrophobic $N H_{2}$ -UiO66(Zr) for versatile functional applications, advancing a novel concept for designing MOFs with controlled wettability for practical uses.
